{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゃぁー(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント本当にありがとっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな皆様からのコメントはいつも嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/9486995/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日仙台に到着して、夜ご飯に皆で牛タンを食べに行ってきたんよぉー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんまかったぁぁぁー(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"羨ましいだろおぉぉー！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで仲良くムシャムシャ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいでホテルの部屋は、飛鳥と一緒だったのよ♪( ´θ｀)ノにっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ファンのみなさまごめなたいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イチャコラしてしまいまちた。照り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが横になってると子猫のように近くに寄ってあみのこと上目遣いで見てくるのあの小娘。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く、可愛いやつめ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/9486995/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/9486995/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つあるベットのなか、なぜか1つのベットに2人仲良く眠りにつきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午前中には皆で地震によって、被害が大きかった場所へ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現実をたたきつけられた気持ちでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごく胸が痛くなったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで起きた出来事を決して忘れないと、目に焼き付けておこうと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから昨日はいろんな気持ちを背負ってピッチで踊らせて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんたくさん暖かい声援をくださった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直に嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもスカパーＪリーグを全力で応援させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ質問かえす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ俺のコメント、面白い？どんな風に見てるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.毎回毎回コメント嬉しいです！ありがとっ(^^)面白くよませていただいてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑデートって聞いてすぐに連想するのはなーに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.にこにこ楽しく遊園地！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ女の子の髪型どんなんが 好きですかっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.巻いてポニーテールとか、ストレートとか？？うん、似合ってればなんでもいいやっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ俺は黒髪でも茶髪でも金髪でもない坊主頭なんだけど、あみあみ族に入れてくれるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.坊主だってなんだってあみあみの事を好きになっちゃった人は必然的にあみあみ族なの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ福祉系に通ってる男ってどう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.素敵だと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんおじいちゃんに優しい人あみ好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ今あみちゃんが欲しいものはなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.お洋服とかお肌が綺麗になるものかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ自分のチャームポイントはどこだと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.しいていうなら目！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑあみあみは夏は好きですか？どんな夏を過ごすのが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.夏は好きな時と嫌いな時といろいろある！汗でベタベタするのは嫌だけど、お祭りとかプールとか好きー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ服とかどこに買いにいくの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.行き当たりばったりだよ！？可愛いのがあればそれがどこのだろうとあみは買っちゃうー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑあみちゃん案外身長高いらあ？ なんセンチ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.163センチ！どうだっ！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ朝早いのにちゃんと睡眠とれてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"t