":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えぇー覚えてないよお！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも腕が細すぎるか大丈夫か？って話はしてた気がする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.Tシャツのキャラクターは何?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.エンジェルウォーズってやつだよ多分...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑあみーさんは、綾鷹好き？あと、もちもち系は...好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.綾鷹好きだしもちもち好きーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ運動するんやったら、何が一番効率良いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑその、めちゃめちゃ良い感じの仕事って...何？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.良い感じ？ＰＶ撮影だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑこびとづかんの中で２番目に好きなキャラってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.リトルハナガシラ！！かわゆ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじゃっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/9486995/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}